  "steps": [
    "Heat the oil and add the cinnamon, cloves and bay leaf for 20 seconds.",
    "Add the onion and green chillies and fry until golden brown.",
    "Stir in the ginger garlic paste and cook until the raw smell goes.",
    "Add the tomatoes with the chilli powder, turmeric, garam masala and salt and cook until mushy and the oil separates.",
    "Add the mint, drained rice and water and bring to a boil.",
    "Cover and cook on low heat for 12 minutes, rest 5 minutes and fluff before serving."
